    <region region-id="120" left="562.0" top="65.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="77.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. Арифметические действия</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="121" left="562.0" top="100.0" width="490" height="49" align-x="562.0" align-y="112.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Пусть z₁ = a + bi, z₂ = c + di. При сложении и вычитании складываем</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">соответствующие части; при умножении используем i² = −1.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">При делении умножаем числитель и знаменатель на c − di.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="122" left="562.0" top="163.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="175.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">c</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:plus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">a</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:real>0.1</ml:real>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">N</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:real>0.9</ml:real>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="123" left="562.0" top="201.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="213.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">d</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:minus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">b</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:real>0.1</ml:real>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">N</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:real>-1.4</ml:real>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="124" left="562.0" top="239.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="251.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z1</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z</ml:id>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-1.5</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>1.0</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="125" left="562.0" top="277.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="289.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z2</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:plus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">c</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:imag symbol="i">1</ml:imag>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">d</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>0.9</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>-1.4</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="126" left="562.0" top="317.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="329.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Сумма: z₁ + z₂ = (a + c) + i(b + d).</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="127" left="562.0" top="343.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="355.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">S</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:plus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z1</ml:id>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z2</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-0.6</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>-0.3999999999999999</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="128" left="562.0" top="386.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="398.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Разность: z₁ − z₂ = (a − c) + i(b − d).</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="129" left="562.0" top="412.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="424.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">D</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:minus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z1</ml:id>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z2</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-2.4</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>2.4</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="130" left="562.0" top="455.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="467.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Произведение: z₁z₂ = (ac − bd) + i(ad + bc).</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="131" left="562.0" top="481.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="493.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Prod</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:mult />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z1</ml:id>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z2</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>0.04999999999999982</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>2.9999999999999996</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="132" left="562.0" top="524.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="536.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Частное: z₁/z₂ = [(ac + bd) + i(bc − ad)] / (c² + d²).</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="133" left="562.0" top="568.0" width="480" height="40" align-x="562.0" align-y="580.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Q</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:div />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z1</ml:id>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z2</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-0.9927797833935018</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>-0.43321299638989164</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="134" left="562.0" top="622.0" width="490" height="49" align-x="562.0" align-y="634.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Точные результаты:</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">S = −3/5 − (2/5)i;     D = −12/5 + (12/5)i;</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Prod = 1/20 + 3i;     Q = −275/277 − (120/277)i.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="135" left="12.0" top="850.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="12.0" align-y="862.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. Сопряжение, обратное число и коллинеарность</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="136" left="12.0" top="892.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="12.0" align-y="904.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">zc</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:minus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">a</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:imag symbol="i">1</ml:imag>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">b</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-1.5</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>-1.0</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="137" left="12.0" top="933.0" width="480" height="38" align-x="12.0" align-y="945.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">zi</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:div />
              <ml:real>1</ml:real>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">z</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:complex>
                <ml:real>-0.46153846153846156</ml:real>
                <ml:imag>-0.3076923076923077</ml:imag>
              </ml:complex>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="138" left="12.0" top="979.0" width="490" height="79" align-x="12.0" align-y="991.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Обозначим O = (0; 0), A = (−3/2; 1), B = (−3/2; −1),</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">C = (−6/13; −4/13). Это точки 0, z, сопряжённого z и 1/z.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Векторы OB = (−3/2; −1) и OC = (−6/13; −4/13)</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">связаны равенством OC = (4/13)·OB, поэтому они коллинеарны.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Следовательно, точки O, B и C лежат на одной прямой.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="139" left="12.0" top="1081.0" width="490" height="79" align-x="12.0" align-y="1093.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Проверка остальных троек по ориентированной удвоенной площади:</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Δ(O,A,B) = (−3/2)(−1) − 1(−3/2) = 3 ≠ 0;</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Δ(O,A,C) = (−3/2)(−4/13) − 1(−6/13) = 12/13 ≠ 0;</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Δ(A,B,C) = 0·(−17/13) − (−2)·(27/26) = 27/13 ≠ 0.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ответ: единственная коллинеарная тройка — 0, сопряжённое z, 1/z.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="140" left="12.0" top="1185.0" width="480" height="70" align-x="12.0" align-y="1197.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Xc</ml:id>
          <ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1">
            <ml:real>0</ml:real>
            <ml:real>-0.46153846153846156</ml:real>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">a</ml:id>
          </ml:matrix>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="141" left="150.0" top="1185.0" width="480" height="70" align-x="150.0" align-y="1197.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Yc</ml:id>
          <ml:matrix rows="3" cols="1">
            <ml:real>0</ml:real>
            <ml:real>-0.3076923076923077</ml:real>
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:neg />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">b</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
          </ml:matrix>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="180" left="300" top="1185.0" width="480" height="25" align-x="300" align-y="1197.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Xa</ml:id>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">a</ml:id>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="181" left="390" top="1185.0" width="480" height="25" align-x="390" align-y="1197.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Ya</ml:id>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">b</ml:id>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="142" left="120.0" top="1275.0" width="285" height="245" align-x="120.0" align-y="1287.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <plot disable-calc="false" item-idref="202" />
    </region>
    <region region-id="143" left="12.0" top="1579.0" width="490" height="34" align-x="12.0" align-y="1591.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Векторы OB и OC коллинеарны: OC = (4/13)·OB.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Следовательно, точки 0, сопряжённое z и 1/z лежат на одной прямой.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="144" left="562.0" top="850.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="862.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Все корни 29-й степени</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="145" left="562.0" top="888.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="900.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">n</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:plus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">N</ml:id>
              <ml:real>5</ml:real>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:real>29</ml:real>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="146" left="562.0" top="928.0" width="480" height="38" align-x="562.0" align-y="940.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">ρ</ml:id>
          <ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default">
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:pow />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">r</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:div />
                <ml:real>1</ml:real>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">n</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:result>
              <ml:real>1.0205295281866922</ml:real>
            </ml:result>
          </ml:eval>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="147" left="562.0" top="975.0" width="490" height="34" align-x="562.0" align-y="987.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Формула Муавра: wₖ = ρ[cos((φ + 2πk)/n) + i sin((φ + 2πk)/n)].</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Здесь k = 0, 1, …, 28. Углы отсчитываются от положительной вещественной оси.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="148" left="562.0" top="1020.0" width="480" height="30" align-x="562.0" align-y="1032.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
          <ml:range>
            <ml:real>0</ml:real>
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:minus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">n</ml:id>
              <ml:real>1</ml:real>
            </ml:apply>
          </ml:range>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="149" left="562.0" top="1055.0" width="480" height="40" align-x="562.0" align-y="1067.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:indexer />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">θ</ml:id>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
          </ml:apply>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:div />
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:plus />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">φ</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:mult />
                <ml:apply>
                  <ml:mult />
                  <ml:real>2</ml:real>
                  <ml:id xml:space="preserve">π</ml:id>
                </ml:apply>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">n</ml:id>
          </ml:apply>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="150" left="562.0" top="1100.0" width="480" height="38" align-x="562.0" align-y="1112.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:indexer />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Xr</ml:id>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
          </ml:apply>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:mult />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">ρ</ml:id>
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">cos</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:indexer />
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">θ</ml:id>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
          </ml:apply>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="151" left="562.0" top="1145.0" width="480" height="38" align-x="562.0" align-y="1157.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:indexer />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Yr</ml:id>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
          </ml:apply>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:mult />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">ρ</ml:id>
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">sin</ml:id>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:indexer />
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">θ</ml:id>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
          </ml:apply>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="152" left="562.0" top="1192.0" width="480" height="38" align-x="562.0" align-y="1204.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
        <ml:define>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:indexer />
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">w</ml:id>
            <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
          </ml:apply>
          <ml:apply>
            <ml:plus />
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:indexer />
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Xr</ml:id>
              <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
            </ml:apply>
            <ml:apply>
              <ml:mult />
              <ml:imag symbol="i">1</ml:imag>
              <ml:apply>
                <ml:indexer />
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">Yr</ml:id>
                <ml:id xml:space="preserve">k</ml:id>
              </ml:apply>
            </ml:apply>
          </ml:apply>
        </ml:define>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region region-id="153" left="670.0" top="1244.0" width="285" height="245" align-x="670.0" align-y="1256.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <plot disable-calc="false" item-idref="203" />
    </region>
    <region region-id="154" left="562.0" top="1554.0" width="490" height="49" align-x="562.0" align-y="1566.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Все 29 значений расположены на окружности |w| = 1,020529528.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Соседние углы отличаются на 2π/29 ≈ 12,413793°. Повторов нет.</p>
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Проверка: wₖ²⁹ = r·exp(i(φ + 2πk)) = z для каждого k.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="155" left="562.0" top="1650.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="1662.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Heading 2" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Таблица всех значений корня</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="156" left="562.0" top="1685.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="1697.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Округление до 6 знаков; вычисления выше сохраняют полную точность.</p>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region region-id="157" left="562.0" top="1717.0" width="490" height="19" align-x="562.0" align-y="1729.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">k       Re(wₖ)              Im(wₖ)                    k       Re(wₖ)              Im(wₖ)</p>
      </text>
    </region>
